  "content": "{title: Sleeping By Myself}\n{artist: Pearl Jam}\n{album: Lightning Bolt (2013)}\n{key: A}\n{tempo: 90}\n\n{section: Intro}\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] / [A] [F#m] [C#m]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] I should have known there was someone else\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] Down below I always kept it to myself\n[D] Now I believe in nothing\n[E] [Eadd2/G] [F#7sus4] [F#7] Not today, as I move myself out of your sight\n[Bm] [E] I'll be sleeping by myself tonight\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] I could never go with no one else\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] The hurt don't show, but who knows Time will tell\n[D] Now I believe in nothing\n[E] But the pain\n[Eadd2/G] [F#7sus4] [F#7] And I can't see this turning out right\n[Bm] [E] I'll be sleeping by myself tonight\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[A] Forever be sad and lonely\n[C#7] [D] Forever never be the same\n[D] [Bm] I close my eyes, wait for a sign\n[E] Am I just waiting in vain?\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[A] [A7] [D/A] [F6] / [A] [A7] [D/A] [Bm] [E]\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[D] [Bm] I close my eyes, wait for a sign\n[E] Am I just waiting in vain?\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] Oh I believe in love and disaster\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] Sometimes the two are just the same\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] I'm beginning to see, what's left of me\n[A] [F#m] [C#m] Is gonna have to be free to survive\n[Bm] [E] I'll be sleeping by myself tonight\n\n{section: Interlúdio 2}\n[A] [A7] [D/A] [Bm] [E]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[D] Now I believe in nothing\n[E] But the pain\n[Eadd2/G] [F#7sus4] [F#7] And I can't see this turning out right\n[Bm] [E] Oh, I'll be sleeping by myself\n[Bm] [E] I'll be sleeping by myself\n[Bm] [Bm/C#] [D] [Bm/F#] [E] [A] I'll be sleeping by myself tonight"
